{"5149240": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Pixel Chaos: Tidy Up the Museum", "steam_appid": 5149240, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Bring Order Back to the Museum</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a grand Victorian museum buried beneath thousands of colorful cubes. Clear the chaotic halls, gather scattered pieces, and restore forgotten pixel art and 3D voxel masterpieces at your own relaxing pace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore Grand Victorian Halls</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the museum’s majestic architecture buried beneath thousands of colorful cubes. Clear the pathways and watch the elegant gallery space emerge from the chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5149240/extras/9295f0d024230cb498bd9c802e12105b.poster.avif?t=1787957581\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5149240/extras/9295f0d024230cb498bd9c802e12105b.webm?t=1787957581\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5149240/extras/9295f0d024230cb498bd9c802e12105b.mp4?t=1787957581\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Restore Hidden Pixel Artworks</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete colorful portraits, animals, creatures, and special collections displayed throughout the museum. Every finished artwork transforms from an empty board into a vibrant museum exhibit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5149240/extras/a38a19cc44edf82ff39225b236d5cbbe.poster.avif?t=1787957581\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5149240/extras/a38a19cc44edf82ff39225b236d5cbbe.webm?t=1787957581\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5149240/extras/a38a19cc44edf82ff39225b236d5cbbe.mp4?t=1787957581\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Rebuild 3D Voxel Exhibits</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not every masterpiece belongs on a wall. Restore fully three-dimensional voxel sculptures and bring charming creatures back to their display stands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5149240/extras/d2d5df173b8b5399676a02a1fadb9399.poster.avif?t=1787957581\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5149240/extras/d2d5df173b8b5399676a02a1fadb9399.webm?t=1787957581\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5149240/extras/d2d5df173b8b5399676a02a1fadb9399.mp4?t=1787957581\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Relax and Tidy Up at Your Own Pace</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect cubes from the enormous piles covering the museum floor and restore order step by step. Enjoy the deeply satisfying transformation of a chaotic museum into a clean, peaceful space.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5149240/extras/17cbea84df6c758887c7c4f085729752.poster.avif?t=1787957581\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5149240/extras/17cbea84df6c758887c7c4f085729752.webm?t=1787957581\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5149240/extras/17cbea84df6c758887c7c4f085729752.mp4?t=1787957581\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Place Cubes, Piece by Piece</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Approach matching spaces and watch them light up to guide your way. Hold to send cubes flying into place and watch every socket snap satisfyingly into the artwork.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5149240/extras/e40cdbd875eb509bf1d2df98b88af02b.poster.avif?t=1787957581\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5149240/extras/e40cdbd875eb509bf1d2df98b88af02b.webm?t=1787957581\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5149240/extras/e40cdbd875eb509bf1d2df98b88af02b.mp4?t=1787957581\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Harness Magic and Clear Faster</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock magical tools to speed up your restoration and gather precise colors in seconds. Master special spells to clean massive piles effortlessly and finish displays even faster.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5149240/extras/88bf17d870a42b9b3ed0b97de5a1ccf0.poster.avif?t=1787957581\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5149240/extras/88bf17d870a42b9b3ed0b97de5a1ccf0.webm?t=1787957581\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5149240/extras/88bf17d870a42b9b3ed0b97de5a1ccf0.mp4?t=1787957581\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A cozy first-person organizing experience</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A richly detailed Victorian museum</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thousands of colorful cubes to collect and place</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Satisfying hold-to-place cube animations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hidden pixel artworks revealed piece by piece</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully three-dimensional voxel sculptures</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Large halls, balconies, display cases, and special exhibits</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A relaxing, pressure-free gameplay loop</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Bring Order Back to the Museum</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a grand Victorian museum buried beneath thousands of colorful cubes. Clear the chaotic halls, gather scattered pieces, and restore forgotten pixel art and 3D voxel masterpieces at your own relaxing pace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore Grand Victorian Halls</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the museum’s majestic architecture buried beneath thousands of colorful cubes. Clear the pathways and watch the elegant gallery space emerge from the chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5149240/extras/9295f0d024230cb498bd9c802e12105b.poster.avif?t=1787957581\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5149240/extras/9295f0d024230cb498bd9c802e12105b.webm?t=1787957581\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5149240/extras/9295f0d024230cb498bd9c802e12105b.mp4?t=1787957581\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Restore Hidden Pixel Artworks</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete colorful portraits, animals, creatures, and special collections displayed throughout the museum. Every finished artwork transforms from an empty board into a vibrant museum exhibit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5149240/extras/a38a19cc44edf82ff39225b236d5cbbe.poster.avif?t=1787957581\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5149240/extras/a38a19cc44edf82ff39225b236d5cbbe.webm?t=1787957581\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5149240/extras/a38a19cc44edf82ff39225b236d5cbbe.mp4?t=1787957581\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Rebuild 3D Voxel Exhibits</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not every masterpiece belongs on a wall. Restore fully three-dimensional voxel sculptures and bring charming creatures back to their display stands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5149240/extras/d2d5df173b8b5399676a02a1fadb9399.poster.avif?t=1787957581\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5149240/extras/d2d5df173b8b5399676a02a1fadb9399.webm?t=1787957581\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5149240/extras/d2d5df173b8b5399676a02a1fadb9399.mp4?t=1787957581\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Relax and Tidy Up at Your Own Pace</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect cubes from the enormous piles covering the museum floor and restore order step by step. Enjoy the deeply satisfying transformation of a chaotic museum into a clean, peaceful space.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5149240/extras/17cbea84df6c758887c7c4f085729752.poster.avif?t=1787957581\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5149240/extras/17cbea84df6c758887c7c4f085729752.webm?t=1787957581\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5149240/extras/17cbea84df6c758887c7c4f085729752.mp4?t=1787957581\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Place Cubes, Piece by Piece</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Approach matching spaces and watch them light up to guide your way. Hold to send cubes flying into place and watch every socket snap satisfyingly into the artwork.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5149240/extras/e40cdbd875eb509bf1d2df98b88af02b.poster.avif?t=1787957581\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5149240/extras/e40cdbd875eb509bf1d2df98b88af02b.webm?t=1787957581\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5149240/extras/e40cdbd875eb509bf1d2df98b88af02b.mp4?t=1787957581\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Harness Magic and Clear Faster</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock magical tools to speed up your restoration and gather precise colors in seconds. Master special spells to clean massive piles effortlessly and finish displays even faster.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5149240/extras/88bf17d870a42b9b3ed0b97de5a1ccf0.poster.avif?t=1787957581\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5149240/extras/88bf17d870a42b9b3ed0b97de5a1ccf0.webm?t=1787957581\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5149240/extras/88bf17d870a42b9b3ed0b97de5a1ccf0.mp4?t=1787957581\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A cozy first-person organizing experience</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A richly detailed Victorian museum</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thousands of colorful cubes to collect and place</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Satisfying hold-to-place cube animations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hidden pixel artworks revealed piece by piece</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully three-dimensional voxel sculptures</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Large halls, balconies, display cases, and special exhibits</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A relaxing, pressure-free gameplay loop</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "A cozy first-person organizing game set in a chaotic Victorian museum. Gather scattered colored cubes, carry them in stacks, and place them into matching slots to reveal pixel artworks and restore charming 3D voxel exhibits.", "supported_languages": "English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Arabic, Simplified Chinese, Portuguese - Brazil, Bulgarian, Danish, Indon